README – Portfolio Design System with ReactJS

Here’s a style guide you can put in your README.md to document the colors and fonts used.

🎨 Colors

Primary Indigo: #4F46E5 (Tailwind indigo-600)

Primary Purple: #8B5CF6 (Tailwind purple-500)

Gray (Body Text): #4B5563 (Tailwind gray-600)

Dark Gray (Headings): #111827 (Tailwind gray-900)

Background White: #FFFFFF

✍️ Fonts

Font Family: Inter, sans-serif (fallback to system-ui)

Headings:

Size: text-4xl (Hero), text-2xl (section titles), text-lg (card titles)

Weight: font-bold or font-semibold

Body Text:

Size: text-base or text-sm

Color: text-gray-600

Weight: font-normal

📐 Layout

Max Width Container: max-w-6xl mx-auto

Padding: px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8

Sections: py-16 spacing

Cards: bg-white shadow rounded-lg hover:shadow-lg transition

🔘 Buttons

Primary Button:

Background: Indigo or Purple (bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-600)

Text: White (text-white font-medium text-sm)

Shape: rounded-lg

Padding: px-6 py-3

Secondary Button (CV Download):

Background: Light Gray (bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200)

Text: text-gray-800

Shape: rounded-lg